  "1. Near a place: GET /api/v1/grid/<floor(lat)>_<floor(lon)>.json (example: Brno 49.19N 16.61E -> grid/49_16.json); check the neighbouring cells for stations within a few km of a border.",
  "2. A whole country and layer: GET /api/v1/<CC>/<layer>.json (CC = ISO 3166-1 alpha-2, layer = gw, rivers, temp, snow).",
  "3. Trust: GET /api/v1/live_record.json and read each network's backtest_by_horizon_months."
 ],
